<description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://fdn.gsmarena.com/imgroot/news/26/07/samsung-galaxy-z-fold8-ultra-ifr/-184x111/gsmarena_000.jpg&quot; width=&quot;184&quot; height=&quot;111&quot; hspace=&quot;3&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; align=left style="background:#333333;padding:0px;margin:0px 4px 0px 0px;border-style:solid;border-color:#aaaaaa;border-width:1px" /&gt; &lt;p&gt;<![CDATA[The new Samsung Galaxy Z Fold8 Ultra landed in our office and it's time to unbox it. The phone ships in a plain box with a (3A) USB-C cable. The Galaxy Z Fold8 Ultra ships in Graphite, Cream and Violet Shadow. Samsung.com’s exclusive fourth color is called Green Shadow.

You can have it in 12/256GB or 12/512GB configurations; prices are €2,200 and €2,400, respectively.



You shouldn't judge the Galaxy Z Fold8 Ultra on its specs or the way it looks on a webpage. Half of the charm of these folding phones is the way they all feel different than your regular slab phone. And the Galaxy Z...]]>&lt;/p&gt;</description>
